config DRM_APPLE_SGX
	tristate "S5L8947X PowerVR SGX543"
	depends on DRM
	depends on ARCH_APPLE_S5L || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on COMMON_CLK && OF
	select DRM_GEM_SHMEM_HELPER
	select DRM_SCHED
	help
	  The GPU of the S5L8947X, a PowerVR SGX543.  Switches it on with
	  the initialisation the stock driver runs, starts the GPU
	  microkernel (from /lib/firmware/s5l8947x/sgx543.fw, which stage2
	  carves from the device's own system image), and offers a render
	  node for test programs and Mesa: GEM buffers in the GPU's address
	  space and renders queued to the microkernel.  Research tools are
	  in debugfs (apple-sgx/).

	  The render node's interface is experimental and will change.

	  If unsure, say N.
